id: pm-slack-standup-2sjh
title: Restore a clean full audit after the unpatched braces advisory is resolved
description: "Certification pm-slack-standup-74w8 has clean production audit and no open repository Dependabot alerts, but full npm audit reports 4 high findings through fast-glob 3.3.3 -> micromatch 4.0.8 -> braces 3.0.3, including pm-ops 2026.10.4. GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm explicitly has no patched version and registry versions stop at 3.0.3. Consume a compatible published fix or canonical scanner replacement, preserve real glob/duplication behavior and all gates, then prove npm audit --omit=dev and npm audit clean. Do not suppress advisory, replace braces with incompatible brace-expansion, or downgrade the required canonical gate to claim clean."
